{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09392","headline":"任洛阳丞请告一首 · 韦应物","name":"任洛阳丞请告一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"方凿不受圆，直木不爲轮。\n揆材各有用，反性生苦辛。\n折腰非吾事，饮水非吾贫。\n休告卧空馆，养病绝嚣尘。\n游鱼自成族，野鸟亦有羣。\n家园杜陵下，千岁心氛氲。\n天晴嵩山高，雪後河洛春。\n乔木犹未芳，百草日已新。\n着书复何爲，当去东臯耘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}